{{define "main"}}
<section class="px-gutter py-12 md:py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-amber-950" role="alert">
            <p class="font-label text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Draft — not approved for publication</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm">This placeholder is not a complete set of terms and is not legal advice. Have qualified counsel and the site owner complete and approve it before relying on it or treating it as final.</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-headline text-4xl text-on-background md:text-display-md">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Draft for use of the Tabiri Analytics website. Effective date and contracting entity: <strong>[confirm and complete]</strong>.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Website use</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> define who may use the site and the rules that apply to access and use.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Content and intellectual property</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> identify ownership, permitted use, restrictions, and any third-party materials.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Disclaimers and liability</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> have counsel draft appropriate warranty disclaimers, limitations of liability, and any exceptions required by law.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Governing terms and contact</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> specify governing law, dispute process, changes to these terms, and an authorized contact method. Until finalized, use the <a class="text-primary underline" href="/contact">contact form</a> to reach Tabiri Analytics.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
{{end}}
